{"data":{"body":"[P3] Remove the obsolete cleanup-budget contract. `PluginRunner.closeHandlerScopes()` closes scopes synchronously, and the invocation waits for that owner before End even with an exhausted runtime budget, as `HandlerScopeHandoffTest` asserts. There is no five-seconds-per-plugin reservation or timeout handoff. Plugin authors following this public Javadoc could rely on a cleanup bound that does not exist. Document the unbounded wait and remove the timeout/reservation claims.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc8AAAABAFEnIA","finding_digest":"7ffc68046b20a7e96ab67486c29cf295615ad3b01b3a5f123e1764bea251fc5a","finding_id":"arf_v1_p76gqbdlect6s2vwosdmfhhssv","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/handler-scoped::lifecycle-contract::bounded-cleanup-guarantee","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/handler-scoped::lifecycle-contract::bounded-cleanup-guarantee","line":23,"observation_digest":"b9518dcaf3abf96af141ce8f80132da46a72d521572ce9180a9d074a6cbc2b3e","observation_id":"aro_v1_xfiy3sxtvp4wv4kbz2hyaeznur","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/HandlerScoped.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-16T23:42:32Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ykrzycszt4u4fvuvsljls4miis","reviewed_base_sha":"67bad28cd9ef1b0808bed193f8a15be75ce457ed","reviewed_head_sha":"96ce0b0a0fcad189dc0693782aa398dd06e447ed","reviewer":"codex","start_line":19,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_744aqrjzxp25qgjm4nhicydhg6"},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_cvhlhawx7nhqfyrikxwita7be6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-16T23:42:32Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
